Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.25,0:00:03.57,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},It had rained in Sol for\Nnine years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.55,0:00:05.43,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},One man never got wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.41,0:00:07.38,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},They called him Aura\NMonster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.36,0:00:10.12,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},Midnight. No umbrella.\NBone dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.10,0:00:11.61,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},The shopkeepers said luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.59,0:00:13.20,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},The police said a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.18,0:00:14.88,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},The kids said magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:17.27,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},So one night, I followed\Nhim into the alleys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.25,0:00:18.22,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},Then I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.20,0:00:20.77,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},He wasn't stopping the\Nrain. He was dodging it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.75,0:00:23.11,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},Every drop. Too fast for\Nthe storm to touch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.09,0:00:23.88,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},He turned.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.86,0:00:25.63,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},"You'll catch a cold,\Nkid."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.61,0:00:26.90,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},"Teach me," I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.88,0:00:28.96,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},So he did. Every night, in\Nthe rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.94,0:00:31.09,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},I held my umbrella. I\Ncouldn't dodge yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.07,0:00:33.36,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},A hundred nights. A\Nthousand drops.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.34,0:00:34.87,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},Then one night, I closed\Nit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.85,0:00:36.33,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},Now there are two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.31,0:00:38.01,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},And we never get wet.
